Files: src/fractasia/* vendor/fractasia/*
Copyright: 2026 Jason Perlow and contributors
License: Apache-2.0
Comment: Original Fractasia driver, data and kernels. Four of the 17 GLSL
 families are adapted from hyprsaver (MIT, 2026 Mara Vexa): ship_glow,
 julia_glow, orbit_trap and mobius. No Fractint source code, .frm formula,
 .map/.par/.ifs asset or colour map is used; Fractint is credited only as the
 source of public type-name/callback metadata (docs/fractasia/LICENSE-ANALYSIS.md).

Files: vendor/magmasimplex/*
Copyright: 2026 Jason Perlow and contributors
License: Apache-2.0
Comment: Original in-house magma/lava-lamp engine shaders.

